#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:smart_callback_routing.res_config_settings_view_form_scr
msgid ""
"While active, the routing API always answers with 'default' — 3CX routes "
"normally everywhere, without any change to the phone system. Outbound "
"mappings are still recorded."
msgstr ""
"Solange aktiv, antwortet die Routing-API immer mit 'default' — 3CX routet "
"überall normal, ohne jede Änderung an der Telefonanlage. Outbound-"
"Zuordnungen werden weiterhin erfasst."

